  "description": "High-performance structured logging for .NET 9. Striped async channel queue, MessageTemplate caching, object pooling, PII masking, correlation ID auto-propagation, per-category log levels, and built-in ASP.NET Core health check. MEL ILogger<T> compatible — drop-in replacement for Serilog/NLog.",
